---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Navbar />

  <div class="pt-24 md:pt-32 px-6 flex-grow">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      
      <!-- HERO / WELCOME SECTION -->
      <header class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] md:tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold mb-4">
          Home Birth Midwifery • Functional Medicine Consulting • Listening Hands Bodywork • Custom Herbalism
        </p>
        
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1e2f23] leading-tight max-w-4xl">
          Precision Science meets Intuitive Maternal & Women's Health Care
        </h1>
        
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-[#1e2f23]/90 leading-relaxed">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#607264]/30 pl-4 py-1">
            <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold block mb-1">Welcome</span>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif italic text-[#3c2f2f]">
              Healthcare That Listens. Science That Illuminates. Wisdom That Remembers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl">
            Welcome to Rooted Moon Medicinals—a private sanctuary where analytical precision meets intuitive care, and where true healing is honored as a holistic, lifelong journey.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl">
            Standard healthcare frequently overlooks the deep, interconnected physiological needs of women across different life stages. Whether you are walking through a season of profound threshold and transformation, listening for the deeper wisdom beneath long-standing health mysteries, or seeking clear answers through advanced biomarker diagnostics, you deserve to be met with dedicated presence, reverent care, and genuine partnership.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl">
            Your physical architecture, your hormonal symphony, your birthing experiences, and the daily rituals you build into your life are all profoundly connected. We center on one core truth: You deserve to be fully listened to, and your unique health story requires a custom-built pathway to lasting vitality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- OUR APPROACH & PHILOSOPHY SECTION -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Philosophy</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Our Approach & Philosophy</h2>
        <p class="text-xl italic text-[#607264] mt-2">
          Science, Intuition, and Habit Evolution in Service of Your Innate Wisdom
        </p>
        
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-[#1e2f23]/90 max-w-3xl">
          At Rooted Moon Medicinals, our approach is grounded in the belief that true healing happens when we reconnect to our essence and align our daily lives with our highest capacity. We practice a rare blend of modern physiological science, intuitive bodywork, and traditional medicine to guide you toward balance, structural integrity, and sustainable growth.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-[#1e2f23]/90">
          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Heart-Centered Deep Listening:</strong> 
            Real healing begins when your full story is held without rush or judgment. We take the time needed to understand your health history, environment, and daily physical reality.
          </li>

          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Bridging Functional Science & Traditional Wisdom:</strong> 
            We leverage state-of-the-art laboratory testing—such as comprehensive blood panels and DNA stool analysis—to map your biochemistry with diagnostic clarity. We integrate these insights with traditional herbal formulations, intuitive bodywork, and body-centered awareness.
          </li>

          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Root-Cause Resolution:</strong> 
            True vitality is built from the ground up. Before addressing complex hormonal cascades, we investigate the underlying physiology of your symptoms to stabilize foundational systems: blood sugar regulation, mineral status, gut integrity, and nervous system tone.
          </li>

          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Habit Evolution & Identity Automation:</strong> 
            True wellness is not a temporary protocol; it is a shift in who you are. We partner with you to design clear, sustainable daily systems—gradually evolving your micro-habits so that optimal nutrition, nervous system grounding, and restorative practices become second nature, effortlessly automating the next version of yourself.
          </li>

          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Honoring Innate Wisdom & Autonomy:</strong> 
            Science provides illuminated insight, but you are the ultimate expert on your own body. We do not dictate your health path; we collaborate with you, honoring your body's inherent capacity to adapt, restore balance, and thrive.
          </li>

          <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong class="text-[#3c2f2f] block text-xl mb-1">Continuity Across Life Stages:</strong> 
            From complete, family-centered home birth midwifery and preconception planning to cycle balance, somatic recovery, and perimenopausal support, we provide continuous care through every major transition.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- OUR SANCTUARY & SPACES OF CARE SECTION -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
        <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Pathways to Engage</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Our Sanctuary & Spaces of Care</h2>
        <p class="text-xl italic text-[#607264] mt-2">
          Dynamic Spaces for Deep Rest, Transformation & Mastery
        </p>
        
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-[#1e2f23]/90 max-w-3xl">
          Healing requires a sanctuary—a place where your nervous system can register safety, unclench, and integrate new patterns. We offer three distinct pathways to engage with our practice:
        </p>

        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">The Office Sanctuary</h3>
              <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#607264] font-semibold block mb-4">In-Person Care</span>
              <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/80">
                Tucked away in Sonoma County, our office treatment space is a warm, intentional haven designed for you to slow down and drop in. Here, you will experience Listening Hands Bodywork—a responsive, highly perceptive touch that listens to your tissue, releases stored tension, and aligns the pelvic bowl—alongside face-to-face functional medicine strategy.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">In-Home Care</h3>
              <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#607264] font-semibold block mb-4">Sanctuary Visits</span>
              <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/80">
                For clients who thrive best in their own environment, we bring our care directly to your sanctuary. Complete home birth midwifery, postpartum recovery bodywork, and dedicated house calls are available in the comfort of your home.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Virtual Consulting</h3>
              <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#607264] font-semibold block mb-4">Functional Medicine</span>
              <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/80">
                For clients seeking root-cause health strategy, lab interpretation, and habit evolution coaching from a distance, we offer comprehensive telehealth sessions via Zoom, offering high-touch care wherever you are located.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[#607264]/10 bg-[#f4f6f4] text-center text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264] py-8 px-6">
    <p>© 2026 Rooted Moon Medicinals. All Rights Reserved. Respecting the innate wisdom of the body.</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>